wo questions from 2004.","CPS demographic method estimates currently cover 2018-2024; earlier subgroup estimates are unavailable here.","EAVS F1 is source-defined participation; older reports can use vote history, poll books or highest-office votes.","State method percentages use only jurisdictions with that method and a positive matched F1a total.","State reporting units are preferred to local component units to avoid double counting.","Separate Maine state-level UOCAVA-only reporting units are preserved but excluded from local-unit method summaries.","A source identifier plus jurisdiction name defines each reporting unit; repeated municipality IDs can represent separate wards.","Methods are not summed or renormalized: absentee may mix mail/in-person and overlap UOCAVA.","Provisional is F1e; early in-person is F1f. F1g is Other in 2008, all-mail from 2010.","Missing, unavailable, not-applicable and valid-skip fields remain missing, never zero.","Explicit unavailable flags override contradictory numeric cells; original values and flags are preserved.","Every source comment and F2 participation-basis field is preserved in jurisdiction downloads.","EAVS reporting units include municipalities and statewide units; they are not automatically counties or precincts.","2006 EAVS acquired but not normalized; 1994 and earlier voting-method observations are not supplied."]}
